          %h2#examples Examples
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                If
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mn 1
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 1
                is a
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/terminal+object"} terminal object
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi Ω
                        %mn 1
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega^1
                is precisely a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subobject+classifier"} subobject classifier
            %li
              %p
                A power object in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
                is precisely a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/power+set"} power set
            %li
              %p
                A category with finite
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limits"} limits
                and power objects for all objects is precisely a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topos"} topos
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi P
                      %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P A
                of any object
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
                in the topos is the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exponential+object"} exponential object
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi P
                      %mi A
                      %mo =
                      %msup
                        %mi Ω
                        %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P A = \Omega^A
                into the
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subobject+classifier"} subobject classifier
            %li
              %p
                See
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Trimble+on+ETCS+I"} Trimble on ETCS I
                for the axiom of power sets in the elementary theory of the category of sets.
